{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶吶，安潔！聽說妳要做一個很厲害的蛋糕是真的嗎？」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0040", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔要做一個巨大的聖誕蛋糕，聽起來好棒啊～」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "jb0033", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼？借了教室去做嗎？全校份的蛋糕太厲害了吧？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "da0049", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……呃，蛋糕的事情好像傳遍校園了呢。」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天從早上開始，就一直有人來詢問。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每個看到安潔的人都問她關於蛋糕的事。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的班上也在討論這件事。」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk1018", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，３年級的班上也討論得很熱烈喔。小菜夏的巨大蛋糕，很厲害的感覺。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0434", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已經是全校等級的話題了呢。」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2608", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到來玩的其他年級的兩人這麼說，安潔一臉認真地點著頭。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這下子責任重大了。」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4112", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過蛋糕本來就是要送給全校，現在的情況也是我想看見的。」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面對語氣調侃的瀨名同學，我勾起嘴角回應。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，雖然變得完全沒有驚喜感了。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2609", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過您說的沒錯，主人。安潔又更鼓起幹勁了！」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2610", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒錯，大家的期待對我們來說是很感激的事。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要回應大家的期待，這個念頭讓我們鬥志高昂。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人，安潔會努力的！」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2611", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天也一起加油吧安潔。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔！沒有問題！」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2612", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是，我們就這樣燃起了幹勁。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以？今天放學後也要去料理實習室嗎？」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0379", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，因為還沒決定要做怎麼樣的蛋糕。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要決定這個還挺困難的呢。」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2613", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～這也是有趣的地方不是嗎？我也去偷看一下好了。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0380", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也去。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk1019", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，遵命。那安潔等你們過來喔！」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2614", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這樣，時間來到了放學。因為學期也快要結束了，所以從今天開始都只有半天課。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安潔鬥志高昂地走向料理實習室──", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比起蛋糕本體，裝飾的部分似乎會花掉更多時間呢。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2615", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，不過多一點裝飾的蛋糕適合慶祝，感覺很棒呢。」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，就像在蛋糕上放用巧克力做的聖誕老人的感覺。塑形巧克力裝飾藝術就是這樣。」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2616", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，那我們就先做出蛋糕本體，剩餘的時間就全部拿來做裝飾怎麼樣？」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～不過既然要做，安潔想做生奶油蛋糕呢……」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2617", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「生奶油沒辦法久放對嗎？」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，所以要在前一晚決勝負。」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2618", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣的話，就必須把除此之外可以事前準備的工作都做完成……」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還有訂購材料之類的事要做呢。其實時間有點急迫，不過這也讓安潔鬥志高昂就是了！」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2619", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，也讓我試吃蛋糕～」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太學長，又一個人來了。」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk1020", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好～請在牆壁這邊排隊喔～現在蛋糕製作小組正在討論～」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0381", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯～」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈哈……」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2620", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔要製作巨大蛋糕」的消息已經傳遍全校，大家都很感興趣的樣子。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "從我們走進料理實習室之後，人潮就像這樣一波波湧來。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的很抱歉。隼太、櫻乃，謝謝你們。」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反正這樣也挺有趣的，沒關係。」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0382", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以什麼時候要做試吃蛋糕？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk1021", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為大方向已經決定了，本來今天不打算做試吃蛋糕的，不過……啊哈哈哈。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2621", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "帶著期待聚集在這裡的人人人們。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果說出今天沒有試吃的話好像會引發暴動……", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……其實我們剛才還談到時間方面很急迫……」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們在旁邊也聽到了。好像有很多事要做所以時間不太夠吧？」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ja0068", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員A", "alt_speaker_idx": 452, "voice": "ra0003", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了一般來參觀（？）的學生之外，料理研的人今天也和我們一起使用料理實習室。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……應該說，她們已經聚過來聽我們討論了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為昨天的試吃，所以又更興致高昂了吧。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久之後。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼辦呢，安潔？」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天乾脆就先滿足大家……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2622", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然接下來的準備會很辛苦，不過目前的狀況也必須解決……", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，我們也想幫忙！不是只站在一邊試吃而已喔！」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ja0069", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……？」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2623", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到意料之外的話，我們睜大了眼睛。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「反正我們暫時要一起使用這間教室，而且好像挺有趣的。」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ja0070", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「巨無霸聖誕蛋糕好夢幻喔～嗯嗯，我們也想做呢！」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社員B", "alt_speaker_idx": 453, "voice": "rb0003", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，安潔！讓我們幫忙吧！！」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": "ja0071", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理研的人異口同聲地說，其他學生們一聽也興致高昂地談論了起來。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像變得很盛大呢。」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對啊，就像文化祭一樣！」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "jc0061", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，我也來幫忙！就像料理實習課那樣一起做！」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最後，開始有這樣的聲音。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦有人開頭，大家就紛紛響應。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要幫忙、讓我幫忙……", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但、但是，各位……」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2624", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣很好欸！雖然沒辦法像安潔以前做的那樣幫忙做學校的工作。」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 429, "voice": "sc0043", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這種小事的話，就可以跟安潔一起做了。」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "jc0062", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇……哇……」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2625", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔跟我面面相覷。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為是想送給大家的禮物，所以原本打算只有我們自己做的……", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在各位的協助之下，完成的送給各位的東西，感覺也很棒呢……」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2626", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……是啊，連這部分都有分享的感覺……」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，我又再次體認到了。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔的人氣。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然她以前一直是野生女僕……", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過還是被學校的所有人親近、喜愛，「大家的女僕」就是這麼回事。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2627", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主人，這樣可以吧？」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2628", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，照安潔想做的做吧。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝您♪」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2629", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她開心地對我露出微笑──", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後很快地轉身面對眾人。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼各位，和安潔一起來做蛋糕吧～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2630", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……原來如此，這就是騷動的原因啊。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4113", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "來料理實習室看看情況的瀨名同學嘆了一口氣。", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然很意外演變成跟大家一起做蛋糕，但還是很開心的事。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過……人數這麼多，實在很難像平常那樣著手做蛋糕。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之、總之請各位聽安潔說！那邊的人請坐下，啊居然弄得那麼亂！？」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2631", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，在做了在做了！」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "da0050", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們也來幫忙了！都是女孩子對吧，知道妳們負責體力活的人手不夠啦！」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "db0031", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「叫我們做什麼都可以！」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "da0051", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你這麼說～～！」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2632", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然安潔站了出來想指揮眾人，不過事態逐漸演變成無法收拾的局面。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我要當負責放草莓的！我喜歡放草莓！」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "sa0041", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等一下等一下，大家請先安靜下來！要先把該做的事情整理出來才行。」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然我也試著和安潔一起控制場面，但是大家你一言我一語地完全沒在聽我們說話。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "眾人的心意讓我們很高興……不過這樣下去……", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是這樣，愛理。」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk1022", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「考試結束後只剩半天課也是原因之一吧……在寒假前大家都很閒。」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4114", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且現在正是喜歡熱鬧的年紀。」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 460, "voice": "sk1023", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼熱鬧，這樣根本只是混亂。」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4115", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，結女的學生太丟臉了……」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4116", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此時，瀨名同學緩緩站了起來。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;「全員肅靜！！！」", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "「全員肅靜！！！」", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4117", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊對不起！？」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2633", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……咦、咦咦？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2634", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在瀨名同學的一吼之後，現場立刻安靜了下來。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "該說不愧是校內無人不知無人不曉的優等生＆學園長之女的力量嗎……", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛、愛理同學？？」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2635", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之大家先聽說明！和特別課程的料理實習課時一樣。」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4118", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們班上的學生，應該全員都被老師指定助手的安潔訓練過了對吧？」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4119", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……啊……」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2636", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學對著還在驚訝的安潔微笑。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在這裡的人，都是想要幫忙安潔才聚集而來的。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4120", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，安潔，下指示吧。」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ar4121", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這就是瀨名同學的「幫忙」，在她的控場之下──", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2637", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳愛理同學！」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2638", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔對不起～剛才興奮過頭了～」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 428, "voice": "sa0042", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會不會……是安潔沒有好好指揮非常抱歉！」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2639", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼各位，首先請聽安潔說！安潔會告訴每個人應該要負責做什麼事。」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2640", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女孩子們很快就恢復冷靜，安潔也有條有理地開始說明。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──看來我還差得遠呢。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為跟安潔抱持同樣的心意，所以就和安潔做同樣的事情是不行的。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這種時候更應該分工合作。這也是「分享」的其中一個重點。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生～我們該做什麼才好？」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 432, "voice": "da0052", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就像瀨名同學說的，跟特別課程的時候一樣喔！」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好！幫忙是吧！」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ht0383", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，也就是說我們負責輔佐安潔。」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 456, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2641", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼就立刻開始說明！各位男生們也請仔細聽喔！」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "ag2642", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「交給我們吧～」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 433, "voice": "db0032", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
